---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park Rides & Attractions Guide"
  description="Lake View Park Islamabad rides and attractions: what is offered for children and families, lakeside activities and what to confirm on-site."
  path="/rides-and-attractions/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What rides and attractions are at Lake View Park?', a: 'CDA’s destination description mentions children’s activities, boating and casual food, Specific rides and their operation change, so expect play areas, lakeside space and operator-run rides and ask on-site what is running.' },
    { q: 'Are the rides free?', a: 'No — children’s rides, play equipment and similar activities are typically charged separately from any park access, by their operators. Confirm the current rate at the counter.' },
    { q: 'Are the attractions suitable for small children?', a: 'The park is a popular family destination and has play areas, but age suitability and supervision requirements vary by activity. Ask the operator and keep children supervised near the water.' },
    { q: 'Do I need to book rides in advance?', a: 'Rides are generally used on the day rather than booked in advance. For boating, see the boating page for availability notes.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Rides & attractions', href: '/rides-and-attractions/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Rides timings', href: '/rides-timings/' },
    { label: 'Kids play areas', href: '/kids-play-areas/' },
    { label: 'Boating', href: '/boating/' },
    { label: 'Ticket prices', href: '/ticket-prices/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Lake View Park combines a lakeside setting with activity areas aimed at families. CDA’s destination description mentions children’s activities, boating and casual food, but specific rides and their operation change — confirm each one on the day.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">For children</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Children’s play and ride areas are a core draw. Which specific rides are operating, their age suitability and any charges are set by the on-site operators, so ask before queuing.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">For families together</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Open lawns, lakeside paths and picnic space let families spend time without needing a paid activity. Half a day is a comfortable amount when you include food and rest breaks.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Lakeside leisure</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Walking, viewpoints and casual photography along Rawal Lake need no separate ticket. These are the most reliable experiences and suit any visit length.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Activities with separate charges</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Boating and individual rides are typically charged separately from entry and parking. Treat their availability and price as “confirm on-site” rather than fixed (see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/ticket-prices/">ticket prices</a> and <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/boating/">boating</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#b3261e] bg-[#fdecea] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#b3261e]">Verify names, ages and prices</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#7a1c16]">Ask the operator or on-site management for the current offer, age limits and prices before you commit.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Confirming on the day</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Because rides and play equipment are operator-run and can change, the most reliable plan is to check what is actually operating when you arrive, then decide. Treat the lakeside walk and open lawns as your guaranteed baseline, and let rides be a bonus you confirm on-site.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Confirm which rides or play equipment are actually operating when you arrive.',
      'Ask each operator for the current rate and age suitability before queuing.',
      'Keep children supervised near the lake at all times.',
      'Budget rides separately from parking and any entry.',
      'Use the map link or Plus Code to reach the correct gate.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg" width="1440" height="960" alt="Lakeside structure at Rawal Lake near Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={3} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
